{"name":"King Ghidorah","hex":"#aa9977","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"king","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A male monarch; a man who heads a monarchy; in an absolute monarchy, the supreme ruler of his nation.","The monarch with the most power and authority in a monarchy, regardless of sex."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To crown king, to make (a person) king.","To rule over as king."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/king"}],"entries":[{"title":"King Ghidorah","blocks":[{"text":"King Ghidorah  is a giant dragon-like extraterrestrial monster, or kaiju, in Toho’s Godzilla media franchise. It first appeared in the 1964 film Ghidorah, the Three-Headed Monster, directed by Ishirō Honda. The character was initially created by Tomoyuki Tanaka, Eiji Tsuburaya, and Shinichi Sekizawa as an homage to the eight-headed mythological Japanese dragon Yamata no Orochi. Although the name of the character is officially trademarked by Toho as \"King Ghidorah\", the character was initially referred to as Ghidrah in some English markets."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/GT3HM_-_King_Ghidorah_on_the_rampage_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-GT3HM_-_King_Ghidorah_on_the_rampage_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/King_Ghidorah","wikidata":"Q1470558"},{"title":"King","blocks":[{"text":"King is a royal title given to a male monarch. A king is an absolute monarch if he holds unrestricted governmental power or exercises full sovereignty over a nation. In a modern context, the title may refer to the ruler of one of a number of modern monarchies. The title of king is used alongside other titles for monarchs: in the West, emperor, grand prince, prince, archduke, duke or grand duke, and in the Islamic world, malik, sultan, emir or hakim, among others."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Aachen_Domschatz_Bueste1.jpg/330px-Aachen_Domschatz_Bueste1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/King","wikidata":"Q12097"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/48/Showa_King_Ghidorah_1965.png/330px-Showa_King_Ghidorah_1965.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/48/Showa_King_Ghidorah_1965.png/330px-Showa_King_Ghidorah_1965.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ghidorah as depicted in Invasion of Astro-Monster","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AShowa_King_Ghidorah_1965.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/aa/Heisei_Ghidorah_1991.png/330px-Heisei_Ghidorah_1991.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/aa/Heisei_Ghidorah_1991.png/330px-Heisei_Ghidorah_1991.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHeisei_Ghidorah_1991.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg/120px-Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg/250px-Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg/120px-Mecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMecha-King_Ghidorah.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/26/Millennium_King_Ghidorah_2001.png/330px-Millennium_King_Ghidorah_2001.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campa